WELCOME TO AKATSUKI

You have been selected because your power serves a purpose. We are ten. We are the
Dawn. The world knows only fragments of what we do, and that is as it should be.

Our purpose is singular: to gather the nine tailed beasts, to seal them, and to
bring about a new order through a power the villages cannot comprehend. Your role
is a piece of that. You will not always be told the whole of it.

You have severed your village. You wear the red cloud now. Your partner is chosen.
Your ring is a key. Somewhere ahead of us stands the Gedo Statue, and it hungers
for nine beasts. You will help feed it.

Ask few questions. Do your part. The Dawn is coming whether the world wills it or not.
